#: passwords.cpp:68
msgid "&Remember passwords"
msgstr "&Nho+' ma^.t kha^?u"

#: passwords.cpp:69
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, kdesu will remember your passwords for the "
"specified amount of time. Until then, you won't have to enter your password "
"again. Keep in mind that this option is insecure and may enable others to "
"damage your system.<p> Please <em>do not</em> use this option if you are "
"working in an insecure environment, for example, on a workstation that is "
"located in a publicly accessible area.<p> This option does not affect "
"passwords explicitly set in other applications, for example, your email "
"account password in KMail."
msgstr ""
"Ne^'u tuy` cho.n na`y ddu+o+.c nha^.n, kdesu se~ nho+' ma^.t kha^?u ba.n go~"
"trong mo^.t khoa?ng tho+`i gian . To+'i khi ddo', ba.n se~ pha?i nha^.p la.i"
"ma^.t kha^?u . Ne^n nho+' ra(`ng, tuy` cho.n na`y kho^ng an toa`n va` co' the^?"
"la`m ho?ng he^. tho^'ng cu?a ba.n . <p> Xin <em>KHO^NG </em> du`ng tuy` "
"cho.n na`y ne^'u ba.n la`m vie^.c trong mo^i tru+o+`ng kho^ng an toa`n vi' du. nhu+"
"1 work station daa(.t o+? no+i truy ca^.p co^ng co^.ng . <p> Tuy` cho.n na`y kho^ng a?n hhu+o+?ng"
"dde^'n ca'c ma^.t kha^?u trong ca'c chu+o+ng tri`nh kha'c, vi' du. trong Kmail ."

#: passwords.cpp:80
msgid "&Timeout"
msgstr "&Timeout"

#: passwords.cpp:85
msgid ""
"You can specify how long kdesu will remember your passwords. A short timeout "
"is more secure than a long timeout."
msgstr ""
"Ba.n co' the^? chi? ddi.nh kdesu se~ nho+' ma^.t kha^?u trong bao la^u . Tho+`i"
